{"screen_name": "baibaibaai", "file": "baibaibaai", "name": "ばあい", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1399104935178895361/BZ7VDNN_.jpg", "header_url": null, "description": "すけぶくん https://skeb.jp/@baibaibaai", "total_works": 42, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/baibaiiba", "name": "baibaiiba"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/69135086", "name": "69135086"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@baibaibaai/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0c7e1c4/uploads/origins/c6976069-3489-4c34-9c7a-331b374019a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56d14aa517edefdafd853d46a0239297", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f0c7e1c4/uploads/origins/c6976069-3489-4c34-9c7a-331b374019a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56d14aa517edefdafd853d46a0239297, https://si.imgix.net/f0c7e1c4/uploads/origins/c6976069-3489-4c34-9c7a-331b374019a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd7a0900b904b88701cd8636af659186 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f0c7e1c4/uploads/origins/c6976069-3489-4c34-9c7a-331b374019a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a64afe1c7b13c324940b1639654d705 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたの絵が大好きです！私のウサギをあなたに描いてもらいたいです！\n\n小柄なのにとてもドヤ顔で、でもお尻は綺麗なんです。\n3枚目の写真のような服装とポーズで、見る人を驚かして振り返っているような感じにしてほしいです。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/cm5u1eycentp2x5/AABaHZ4ErVaIVf8HNSsnktFga?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@baibaibaai/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ae10734f/uploads/origins/6760aa39-687e-40fa-a48b-f52d6728327e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba562d47b55b8fc6b6c6f893750739d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ae10734f/uploads/origins/6760aa39-687e-40fa-a48b-f52d6728327e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba562d47b55b8fc6b6c6f893750739d, https://si.imgix.net/ae10734f/uploads/origins/6760aa39-687e-40fa-a48b-f52d6728327e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41310666604e58b8268f311f6d79d8a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ae10734f/uploads/origins/6760aa39-687e-40fa-a48b-f52d6728327e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee8050119efe79bc19eed363cb822102 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のプレゼントの当選者の一人を描いてもらえるとうれしいです！どんな風に描いていただいても構いませんが、夏の季節をイメージしてください。海辺とか公園とか。私のお願いを聞いてくれてありがとうございます！ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/EliseVTuberr/status/1625218483033079809?t=XU9HXzyzpzHkCgk1OOPUaw&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@baibaibaai/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e6f30e5c/uploads/origins/df644240-8686-4613-a876-9fbc1a2dae92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff36ebf5f84f1f3875507365fdf27dcb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e6f30e5c/uploads/origins/df644240-8686-4613-a876-9fbc1a2dae92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff36ebf5f84f1f3875507365fdf27dcb, https://si.imgix.net/e6f30e5c/uploads/origins/df644240-8686-4613-a876-9fbc1a2dae92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a77b2a3db20100cb6c0b81466be0ebb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e6f30e5c/uploads/origins/df644240-8686-4613-a876-9fbc1a2dae92?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b8c6c04b1528e1d78eaef7809532946 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ばあい様\n初めましての者です\nキャラはＦＥよりシーダ（伝承Ver.）\nhttps://twitter.com/RAMU_INU/status/1514222144758038535/photo/1\n\nリクエストは主人公にフェラで奉仕するシーン（イメージ↓）\nhttps://bokasitter.net/p/e8217a5c819c4026adf3965a506c0679\n\n主人公はザックリ適当で構いません（青髪＆ティアラ）\nhttps://gamepress.gg/feheroes/hero/young-marth\n\nシーダの髪型などはこちらも参考に\nhttps://twitter.com/RAMU_INU/status/1514222215876669442/photo/1\n\n幼少期の主人公(将来の旦那)についイタズラしてしまう状況\n身分は主人公(大国の王子)＞シーダ(小国の王女)ですが立場は逆転\nもし可能でしたら口内射精の差分、口からこぼれた精液を\n手の平で受ける差分(目がハート)も希望します（手間でしたら不要）\n衣装の細かい部分は省略可、詳細はお任せ致します\n\n恐らく初見キャラかと存じます\n内容的に難しければキャンセル下さいませ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@baibaibaai/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f72400a3/uploads/origins/1e51708d-5f49-42c8-af52-d990230ee6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=266da4571c70ca1fa55cfdff1bbd2e76", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f72400a3/uploads/origins/1e51708d-5f49-42c8-af52-d990230ee6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=266da4571c70ca1fa55cfdff1bbd2e76, https://si.imgix.net/f72400a3/uploads/origins/1e51708d-5f49-42c8-af52-d990230ee6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ef45ad08aa70f7c8e61a4b6e24fd62f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f72400a3/uploads/origins/1e51708d-5f49-42c8-af52-d990230ee6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e9a9b1898c244664c527b697c78b82a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@baibaibaai/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/19b6cf38/uploads/origins/8ba3d023-659b-4ff4-9d66-2df716099218?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&f